    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GLT301 · Assessment 2/6</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14250 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GLT301 · Đầu điểm 2/6</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14250 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">9 weeks</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO 1,2,3,4,5,6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: The class should be divided into 4 or 6 groups. Each group will choose a company and conduct an in-depth analysis of its supply chain management practices. The analysis should include: Company background and industry context; Supply chain structure and key components; Logistics strategies and operational processes; Performance metrics and outcomes; Recommendations for improvement.<br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">OPT1: Report's length: 3500-4000 words<br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">OPT1: All chapters and learning materials covered in the course.<br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">OPT1: Take-Home and Classroom<br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">OPT1:<br>- Groups present their work on their assigned dates<br>- Groups must submit their reports in time.<br>- Any proof of plagarism will result in grade 0 for the assignment for all members of the groups.<br>- Group assignment grade will be given based on the quality of the presentation and report with regard to the correctness and clarity of the explanation, as well as students' ability in addressing questions and concerns raised by their peers and the lecturer.<br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 54 — Individual assignment submission</li><li>Session 55 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 56 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 57 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 58 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 59 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 60 — Group presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 54 — Individual assignment submission</li><li>Buổi 55 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 56 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 57 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 58 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 59 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 60 — Group presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=GLT301\">Exam Room — GLT301</a> (3 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=GLT301\">Phòng thi — GLT301</a> (3 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
